      "ko": "그 이름의 영광을 찬양하고 영화롭게 찬송할찌어다",
      "source_text_hash": "89fa1f8bcf10d89a2672b7b8a36cf43ea1ddd5cbfb5f1a7dc9ca3dd9ba3e7c3d",
      "translation_text_hash": "58cb92e845c5d04cc8aa1124117500a1e59206aa017c54c63dc51b2d62a6ba11",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
      "source_edition": "KRV-1961",
